BT 1 0 0 1 0 99 Tm 12 TL /F1 9 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Eight observational puzzles in radio astronomy, gamma-ray physics, and cosmology are examined through the lens of the) Tj T* (Wike Coherence Law C = C0 x exp\(-alpha x gamma_eff\). The ARCADE 2 excess radio background \(5-6x brighter than) Tj T* (known sources\) is identified as vacuum decoherence radiation -- photons emitted as vacuum coherence continuously) Tj T* -0.100235 Tw (decays at the lowest available energy scale. The galactic bulge 511 keV emission \(~10^43 positron annihilations per second) Tj T* 0 Tw (from an unknown source\) is traced to enhanced nuclear decoherence at the galactic center, where gamma_eff is maximal.) Tj T* (The EDGES 21-cm absorption anomaly, anomalous gamma-ray transparency, cosmic ray anisotropies, the drop in) Tj T* (Lyman-alpha emitters at z > 7, and anomalous quasar proximity zones each receive closures from the coherence) Tj T* -0.10995 Tw (framework. One anomaly -- the Arp quasar-galaxy associations -- is closed by rejection: the data do not support it. Not every) Tj T* 0 Tw (puzzle is real. Honesty requires saying so.) Tj T* ET
